                            <comment id="16152402" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 4 Sep 2017 09:50:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user sunnychanwork opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2583&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2583&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6252&quot; title=&quot;Cassandra Cache Store Session does not retry if prepare statement failed&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6252&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6252&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Cassandra Cache Store Session does not retry if statement&#8230;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &#8230; failed&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This patch will check to ensure that we retry any prepare statement failure when we submit the async request to Cassandra&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

